{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost too many times to the house? It's time to make it back. Welcome to The House Never Wins, where its your time to take back your money from the casino. Unlock coins, modify your slot machine, and run through Vegas, bankrupting all the casinos you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock, use and combine over 100 coins to break the rules and try to turn the odds in your favour!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/2ec7b2e1eac85a5e0b617f53d2b0a293.poster.avif?t=1758988419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/2ec7b2e1eac85a5e0b617f53d2b0a293.webm?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/2ec7b2e1eac85a5e0b617f53d2b0a293.mp4?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tickets from  bankrupting casinos, and use tickets to purchase coin rolls, which give you a chance of unlocking new coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/bf6cae5fa5f7e4a3ebcd5ba64bb7c60c.poster.avif?t=1758988419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/bf6cae5fa5f7e4a3ebcd5ba64bb7c60c.webm?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/bf6cae5fa5f7e4a3ebcd5ba64bb7c60c.mp4?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to just earn some extra tickets without playing a full run? Enjoy two mini-games, Blackjack and Mines (with many more to come in the future)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/3b24554980a4042e9ff16c8658a9e742.poster.avif?t=1758988419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/3b24554980a4042e9ff16c8658a9e742.webm?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/3b24554980a4042e9ff16c8658a9e742.mp4?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/3f6ab6dec49e4c885916f6d9f86cb0cf.poster.avif?t=1758988419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/3f6ab6dec49e4c885916f6d9f86cb0cf.webm?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878990/extras/3f6ab6dec49e4c885916f6d9f86cb0cf.mp4?t=1758988419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play over 50 unique casinos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play over 100 unique, game bending coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and bankrupt every casino without alerting the pit boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play two  mini-games. Mines and Blackjack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 20 Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble in every way imaginable!</p></li></ul><p cl